get works (all corpora) where date <= (2019-08-23) and (title-abstract-keywords has (maize OR corn OR (stemmed "Zea mays")) or keyword is [maize](keywords/maize)) and (title-abstract-keywords has (field OR plot OR location OR trial OR (stemmed "farm scale") OR scouting OR trap OR trapping OR sampling OR monitoring) or keyword is [farm size](keywords/farm-size)) and title-abstract-keywords has (transgenic OR Bt OR (stemmed "Bacillus thuringiensis") OR GM OR (stemmed "genetically modified") OR (stemmed "genetically engineered") OR "Cry*" OR "Vip*")
